# the tape: HOME held shows the recorded track's harmony bar by bar (let go: still the tape); K2 PART steps along the
# parts in use and then one NEW (no letter skipped); ROAD's white keys add a block at the end
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
turn K2 1
turn K2 -1
wait 50
expect bars 4
tap REC
wait 3200
key w4 down 100
wait 3000
key w4 up
key w7 down 100
wait 3000
key w7 up
key w5 down 100
wait 3000
key w5 up
key w3 down 100
wait 3000
key w3 up
tap REC
wait 300
press HOME
wait 700
shot harmony.png
release HOME
wait 50
expect page 7
tap PLAY
wait 100
turn K2 1
wait 50
expect part 1
turn K2 1
turn K2 1
wait 50
expect part 1
turn K2 -1
wait 50
expect part 0
tap ENV
wait 50
turn K1 -5
tapkey w3
wait 50
expect road1 3
expect textfit 0
